  <metadata>
    <name>La Bresse – Hohneck loop</name>
    <desc>La Bresse up the D34 and the Route des Américains, along the Route des Crêtes to the Hohneck, round the summit's car park and back down the same roads to La Bresse's second roundabout, round it, and up again (a lap). Route along OpenStreetMap roads (map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL), made with BRouter; elevation from IGN RGE ALTI (Licence Ouverte 2.0).</desc>
    <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors"><license>https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/</license></copyright>
  </metadata>
